=== Async SQLAlchemy (cubrid+aiopycubrid) Demo ===

[1] Created table cookbook_async_orm_demo
[2] Inserted 3 rows asynchronously

[3] Rows ordered by score DESC:
    id=1  name=alice  score=90
    id=3  name=carol  score=88
    id=2  name=bob  score=75

[4] Updated bob's score to 95

[5] Dropped table and closed engine

--- async SQLAlchemy URL formats ---
  Sync:   cubrid+pycubrid://user:pass@host:port/db
  Async:  cubrid+aiopycubrid://user:pass@host:port/db

Requirements: pycubrid>=1.6, sqlalchemy-cubrid>=1.4.2, SQLAlchemy>=2.0
